## Token System

### What are Tokens?

Tokens are key-value pairs defined in `dex.config.json`:
- **Key**: `button-primary` (used in parameters)
- **Value**: `#0052ED` (defined in config)

### Token Grouping

Grouping is automatic based on prefix:

| Prefix        | Group     | Examples                          |
| ------------- | --------- | --------------------------------- |
| `text-*`      | text      | text-primary, text-secondary      |
| `button-*`    | button    | button-primary, button-small      |
| `container-*` | container | container-small, container-medium |
| `badge-*`     | badge     | badge-small, badge-large          |
| `table-*`     | table     | table-small, table-medium         |
| `spacer-*`    | spacer    | spacer-small, spacer-large        |
| `general-*`   | general   | general-color-1, general-color-2  |
| `page-*`      | page      | page-background-primary           |

### dex.config.json Structure

```json
{
  "colors": {
    "light": {
      "button-primary": "#0052ED",
      "text-primary": "#001242"
    }
  },
  "dimensions": {
    "container-small": "24px",
    "button-small": "8px 24px"
  },
  "fonts": {
    "dm-sans": ""
  },
  "borders": {
    "border-primary": {
      "radius": "25px",
      "width": "1px",
      "color": "#E5E7EB",
      "style": "solid"
    }
  }
}
```

